WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:04.270
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.270 --> 00:07.100
Become entwined in chains

00:07.100 --> 00:10.540
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.540 --> 00:14.910
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.910 --> 00:21.040
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.320 --> 00:26.580
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.390 --> 00:32.660
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.460 --> 00:38.960
Just one life that is out there

00:40.470 --> 00:45.740
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.540 --> 00:52.310
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.310 --> 00:58.650
Must surely exist

00:58.650 --> 01:01.920
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.920 --> 01:04.860
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.860 --> 01:08.200
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.200 --> 01:12.570
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.570 --> 01:16.970
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:32.490 --> 01:34.190
Hey, hey, do you know?

01:34.190 --> 01:38.630
I heard men have some funky
tube stuck between their legs!

01:38.630 --> 01:39.390
No way!

01:39.390 --> 01:41.300
Are you sure it's not antennae?

01:41.300 --> 01:43.130
I wonder if it makes it hard to walk...

01:43.130 --> 01:45.030
Gross!

01:45.030 --> 01:46.730
It must feel weird!

01:52.970 --> 01:55.640
G-Get out!

01:58.810 --> 02:00.550
Why, why, why?

02:00.550 --> 02:02.880
Even the stuff that
usually comes out won't!

02:04.850 --> 02:06.690
I just wanted to know more.

02:06.690 --> 02:07.860
Pyoro!

02:07.860 --> 02:09.290
Let's see...

02:09.290 --> 02:12.090
We want to get rid of this
unfashionable name of Ikazuchi.

02:12.090 --> 02:16.030
So I'm looking for
a name fitting for this ship!

02:16.030 --> 02:16.930
And so...

02:16.930 --> 02:19.070
The person who comes
up with the name we use,

02:19.070 --> 02:23.910
will get one year's worth of
food certificates at the Trapeza!

02:23.910 --> 02:26.040
A year's worth?

02:26.040 --> 02:26.810
What's this?

02:26.810 --> 02:28.080
Nirvana?

02:28.080 --> 02:29.310
Isn't that corny?

02:29.310 --> 02:31.380
The vice-captain came up with that.

02:31.380 --> 02:33.210
How do we name the ship?

02:33.210 --> 02:35.440
You just enter it into Pyoro!

02:36.250 --> 02:36.980
Pyoro?

02:37.650 --> 02:39.420
Ms. Parfet gave me that name!

02:39.420 --> 02:41.590
Isn't it a good name?

02:41.590 --> 02:43.990
Well, I'll say "Luxury Night."

02:43.990 --> 02:45.630
Thanks for putting it in, Pyoro.

02:45.630 --> 02:47.650
A night of underwear?
That's lingerie!

02:56.140 --> 02:59.370
Such an organ does
not exist in a man's body.

02:59.370 --> 03:01.080
It's called the uterus.

03:01.080 --> 03:02.610
It's for reproduction?

03:02.610 --> 03:04.180
Interesting.

03:04.180 --> 03:06.410
I wanted a baby.

03:06.410 --> 03:07.970
So I got a seed.

03:08.720 --> 03:09.780
Seed?

03:09.780 --> 03:11.790
I get an egg from a ohma,

03:11.790 --> 03:15.720
and we splice the genes
of the ferma into it,

03:15.720 --> 03:17.860
planting it into the uterus.

03:17.860 --> 03:20.590
Anyone who wants
to be a ferma can be one.

03:23.060 --> 03:25.500
So I can be one, too?

03:25.500 --> 03:26.020
Huh?

03:31.870 --> 03:32.460
BC.

03:34.010 --> 03:36.780
The communication pod
is ready for launch.

03:36.780 --> 03:38.710
Why is there an extra one?

03:38.710 --> 03:41.880
This one is for Tarak.

03:41.880 --> 03:45.890
I thought we needed to inform
Tarak of this crisis as well.

03:45.890 --> 03:47.420
Well, all right. Do it.

03:47.420 --> 03:48.980
Yes, launching now.

04:01.440 --> 04:02.660
All hands, prepare for combat!

04:05.010 --> 04:05.870
An enemy attack?

04:08.880 --> 04:10.280
Dita, what are you doing?

04:10.280 --> 04:11.180
Board your Dread.

04:11.180 --> 04:14.120
Mr. Alien already rushed out.

04:14.120 --> 04:16.450
He's really fast! Zoom!

04:16.450 --> 04:18.250
He left? Already?

04:18.250 --> 04:20.950
Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on!

04:48.150 --> 04:49.780
Didja see that, women?

04:50.920 --> 04:53.980
In the end,
you can't live without me!

05:04.470 --> 05:05.270
What?

05:05.270 --> 05:07.770
Didja come here to thank me?

05:07.770 --> 05:09.240
Don't be so conceited.

05:09.240 --> 05:11.640
Your solo performance
was too dangerous.

05:11.640 --> 05:13.270
Next time, act on my orders.

05:14.980 --> 05:16.110
Don't make me laugh.

05:16.110 --> 05:19.380
If you're afraid of danger,
you can't beat the enemy.

05:19.380 --> 05:20.720
Well, don't worry.

05:20.720 --> 05:23.350
I'll take care
of you with my expertise!

05:23.350 --> 05:25.220
The weaker the dog,
the more it barks.

05:26.150 --> 05:27.160
That's true.

05:27.160 --> 05:29.260
But it's better than no bark at all.

05:29.260 --> 05:31.130
You're not the one that's great.

05:31.130 --> 05:32.730
It's that weapon!

05:32.730 --> 05:34.030
What was that, bitch?

05:34.030 --> 05:35.660
I only spoke the truth.

05:35.660 --> 05:36.900
You lookin' down on me?

05:36.900 --> 05:38.030
Who do you think you are?

05:38.030 --> 05:39.570
You're our prisoner!

05:39.570 --> 05:42.540
And who were the ones
who were saved by a prisoner?

05:46.770 --> 05:49.480
- Hey, everyone!
- Come to me!

05:49.480 --> 05:50.680
Like I said...

05:50.680 --> 05:53.510
I saved you,
so you oughta listen to me!

05:53.510 --> 05:55.680
Isn't that how the world goes around?

05:55.680 --> 05:57.950
How the world turns, huh?

05:57.950 --> 06:00.390
So what would you like me to do?

06:00.390 --> 06:02.960
First, do something about that girl!

06:02.960 --> 06:05.690
The annoying one that
goes "alien this," "alien that"!

06:05.690 --> 06:07.260
Oh, Dita...

06:07.260 --> 06:10.300
And the creepy one with that
weird contraption on her face!

06:10.300 --> 06:12.170
Make her quit complaining!

06:12.170 --> 06:15.300
She doesn't need to
butt in on a man's fight!

06:15.300 --> 06:17.700
He's really bad at making a case.

06:18.810 --> 06:20.410
Let's see...

06:20.410 --> 06:22.840
Then how about working
with the Reg crew?

06:22.840 --> 06:24.210
Reg crew?

06:24.210 --> 06:25.550
It's an amazing job.

06:25.550 --> 06:27.780
And it's under a different boss, too.

06:27.780 --> 06:29.350
A different boss?

06:29.350 --> 06:30.650
I'll take it on!

06:32.220 --> 06:34.060
Was that all right?

06:34.060 --> 06:34.790
Yes.

06:34.790 --> 06:36.220
Thank you very much.

06:36.220 --> 06:39.260
Gascogne will take care of the rest.

06:39.260 --> 06:39.990
Yes.

06:39.990 --> 06:44.530
Men acting on their own
risks damaging the pilots' morale.

06:44.530 --> 06:45.120
Out.

06:46.900 --> 06:49.700
She's still got a square head,
as always.

06:49.700 --> 06:51.770
What a mean woman!

06:51.770 --> 06:54.080
How long are you going to eavesdrop?

06:54.080 --> 06:54.910
Going now!

06:56.840 --> 06:59.680
Sheesh, why do I get
the flak for this?

07:01.220 --> 07:03.120
I switched to auto-pilot!

07:03.120 --> 07:04.210
I'm getting some rest!

07:05.290 --> 07:07.920
Is this Reg?

07:07.920 --> 07:09.220
Welcome!

07:10.860 --> 07:12.190
What?

07:14.100 --> 07:16.730
W-Welcome.

07:16.730 --> 07:19.800
This is our easy-to-read menu...

07:19.800 --> 07:22.240
Uh, we recommend the Kamikaze Set.

07:22.240 --> 07:23.730
The regular menu...

07:25.140 --> 07:27.840
I can't do this!

07:27.840 --> 07:28.910
But you were doing it.

07:28.910 --> 07:31.450
What the hell is this Kamikaze Set?

07:31.450 --> 07:32.580
I don't get it at all!

07:32.580 --> 07:35.570
It's a set with enough
fuel for one way and a bomb.

07:37.080 --> 07:39.420
It was modeled after men.

07:39.420 --> 07:41.660
S-So you're the boss here?

07:41.660 --> 07:42.990
What is this place?

07:42.990 --> 07:45.560
You just sit and smile all the time!

07:45.560 --> 07:48.260
Seeing friends take off with a smile.

07:48.260 --> 07:50.900
That's the most important job at Reg.

07:50.900 --> 07:51.930
Smile?

07:51.930 --> 07:53.730
What part of this is so great?

07:53.730 --> 07:55.000
This pisses me off!

07:55.840 --> 07:57.610
It's a great job.

07:57.610 --> 08:01.580
Pilots aren't all flying by themselves.

08:01.580 --> 08:05.750
They can fight because
of a lot of help they get.

08:05.750 --> 08:08.820
In other words, we're stagehands.

08:08.820 --> 08:10.720
Stagehands?

08:10.720 --> 08:12.620
It looks like Reg isn't for you.

08:12.620 --> 08:14.620
Come on back.

08:14.620 --> 08:15.280
Back?

08:19.660 --> 08:21.820
I think I'll ask you
to do warehouse inventory.

08:25.170 --> 08:26.700
How is it?

08:26.700 --> 08:28.700
You get to take care
of deadly weapons.

08:28.700 --> 08:30.300
Isn't it an amazing job?

08:32.270 --> 08:35.870
It's not bad, but it puts
me back in a hellhole.

08:38.050 --> 08:42.020
I came here because I hated
being stuck in dark rooms!

08:42.020 --> 08:45.610
And you want me to go
back to places like these?

08:46.950 --> 08:49.320
Hey, so you are one of us.

08:51.590 --> 08:52.790
What is this?

08:53.900 --> 08:55.830
It's food on Tarak.

08:55.830 --> 08:58.260
Food? Men's?

08:59.670 --> 09:03.470
One tablet assures
300 hours of labor.

09:03.470 --> 09:04.710
I see...

09:04.710 --> 09:06.400
Have you seen Mr. Alien?

09:07.170 --> 09:09.240
I heard he went to Reg.

09:09.240 --> 09:10.180
Reg?

09:11.310 --> 09:12.810
Oh, what's that?

09:12.810 --> 09:15.150
I hear this is the alien's food.

09:15.150 --> 09:16.080
Really?

09:17.820 --> 09:19.820
You're eating it?

09:19.820 --> 09:20.620
How is it?

09:20.620 --> 09:22.890
I feel sorry he had
to eat this stuff...

09:24.160 --> 09:25.730
I know!

09:25.730 --> 09:28.330
Oh, give us a name first!

09:28.330 --> 09:29.320
Roswell!

09:31.130 --> 09:33.370
This is the women's kingdom?

09:33.370 --> 09:35.570
Hey, it's pretty gaudy.

09:35.570 --> 09:36.600
Yeah...

09:36.600 --> 09:38.840
Gaudy, beautiful, and clean.

09:38.840 --> 09:41.670
But I hated the fact
it was all so superficial.

09:43.310 --> 09:45.010
Mejale is a country,

09:45.010 --> 09:48.480
where everyone is friendly
and has a good time.

09:48.480 --> 09:50.920
But that's just on the outside.

09:50.920 --> 09:54.220
Women have a sense of showing off

09:54.220 --> 09:58.560
and they want their gardens to
look better than their neighbor's.

09:58.560 --> 10:01.130
They kept using excessive
energy because of that,

10:01.130 --> 10:05.070
and as a result, one of
the units had to be shut down.

10:05.070 --> 10:09.400
Our captain, with no place to go,
created this pirate fleet for us.

10:13.610 --> 10:16.010
There is no "men or women" for pirates.

10:16.010 --> 10:18.880
Your lives were spared.

10:18.880 --> 10:21.380
If this was the real Mejale army,

10:21.380 --> 10:23.850
you would've been dead before
you could bark a single word.

10:26.920 --> 10:27.580
Here!

10:29.120 --> 10:33.390
Well, you're like us in that
you've got nowhere to go, right?

10:33.390 --> 10:37.000
The rule here is that
you have to work to eat.

10:37.000 --> 10:38.870
You're free to bark,
but before that...

10:38.870 --> 10:41.770
Well, at least work enough to bark.

10:41.770 --> 10:44.770
But then what do l...

10:44.770 --> 10:46.470
Smile! Smile!

10:47.980 --> 10:49.170
Fine!

10:50.750 --> 10:51.850
Enemy ship!

10:51.850 --> 10:53.210
Distance, 3000Gr!

10:53.210 --> 10:54.850
It's moving fast!

10:54.850 --> 10:56.550
It's a rather hurried one there.

10:56.550 --> 10:57.650
How many?

10:57.650 --> 10:59.590
Just the one!

10:59.590 --> 11:01.860
Distance, 2500Gr!

11:01.860 --> 11:04.930
It's showtime, young man.

11:04.930 --> 11:07.230
They really handle people roughly here!

11:07.230 --> 11:08.390
Distance, 1800!

11:10.530 --> 11:13.270
Why is this ship so damn huge?

11:13.270 --> 11:14.940
Show us something good!

11:14.940 --> 11:16.560
I'm good at running away!

11:18.410 --> 11:19.400
I figured that...

11:21.610 --> 11:24.130
I'll run even to the
ends of the universe!

11:33.220 --> 11:34.650
What's going on here?

11:44.170 --> 11:46.530
The flying object is keeping
a set distance from us

11:46.530 --> 11:48.140
and holding that position.

11:48.140 --> 11:50.040
Bart, stay on this course!

11:50.040 --> 11:51.310
Meia, launch the Dreads!

11:51.310 --> 11:52.410
Prepare for combat!

11:52.410 --> 11:52.900
Roger!

11:55.540 --> 11:57.380
What have you been doing?

11:57.380 --> 11:58.280
Leader!

11:58.280 --> 11:59.380
This isn't a game!

11:59.380 --> 12:01.850
Lateness can be the difference
between life and death!

12:02.720 --> 12:04.240
I-I'm sorry...

12:05.050 --> 12:07.190
Let's try a formation attack.

12:07.190 --> 12:08.720
Be on guard.

12:08.720 --> 12:10.060
R-Roger!

12:10.060 --> 12:11.550
All right, time to go!

12:12.630 --> 12:15.030
Stagehands don't get up on stage.

12:15.030 --> 12:15.830
What?

12:15.830 --> 12:17.160
Welcome!

12:17.160 --> 12:18.370
Can I have the A set?

12:18.370 --> 12:19.930
Of course!

12:19.930 --> 12:23.070
Would you like a homing
missile with that?

12:23.070 --> 12:25.210
I don't want to make
the ship too heavy...

12:25.210 --> 12:26.940
...but all right, add it on.

12:26.940 --> 12:27.810
Thank you very much!

12:27.810 --> 12:29.880
That's the job of the stagehand.

12:29.880 --> 12:30.870
And so...

12:31.810 --> 12:32.470
There.

12:33.980 --> 12:35.920
What are you doing!?

12:35.920 --> 12:39.090
For today, you get
to watch what we do.

12:39.090 --> 12:39.640
All right?

12:40.420 --> 12:42.190
Topping gates in operation.

12:42.190 --> 12:45.660
Danger. Please do not enter from the gate.

12:45.660 --> 12:47.650
The topping for the A set is going in!

12:53.800 --> 12:55.400
Barnette, going out!

12:55.400 --> 12:56.300
Take care!

13:16.720 --> 13:18.780
The sphere is still standing still.

13:20.560 --> 13:22.530
Why aren't they doing anything?

13:22.530 --> 13:24.690
The Dread team's setup is complete.

13:30.100 --> 13:31.440
It's starting to move!

13:41.420 --> 13:43.150
S-Sea urchin?

13:43.150 --> 13:45.320
Wait, are we going to fight that thing?

13:45.320 --> 13:46.320
Calm down, Jura.

13:46.320 --> 13:48.590
Team leaders, check your formations.

13:48.590 --> 13:50.220
All teams, commence attack!

13:50.220 --> 13:50.880
Roger!

14:03.840 --> 14:05.930
No good, Meia.
Those needles get in the way.

14:06.910 --> 14:08.740
So they are bad aliens!

14:10.040 --> 14:12.810
They've been observing
our actions and analyzing us...

14:12.810 --> 14:15.280
Perhaps they wish
to eliminate us now.

14:15.280 --> 14:16.450
We're going to collide!

14:16.450 --> 14:17.420
Young man!

14:17.420 --> 14:18.410
I-I know!

14:21.460 --> 14:22.050
Ow!

14:24.360 --> 14:25.830
Starboard arm damaged!

14:25.830 --> 14:26.490
Barriers!

14:27.830 --> 14:29.430
Enemy turning about 180 degrees!

14:29.430 --> 14:31.420
Dread force is down to 85%!

14:35.540 --> 14:37.570
That thing is too fast!

14:37.570 --> 14:39.740
Leader, let's call Mr. Alien here!

14:39.740 --> 14:41.510
Alien?

14:41.510 --> 14:42.740
No!

14:42.740 --> 14:43.880
He's a man!

14:43.880 --> 14:44.710
An enemy!

14:44.710 --> 14:45.780
Have you forgotten?

14:45.780 --> 14:48.020
But he's a good alien!

14:48.020 --> 14:50.480
I told you not to rely
on the strength of others!

14:50.480 --> 14:51.550
We'll do this...

14:51.550 --> 14:52.750
...on our own!

14:59.860 --> 15:01.900
Ms. Gasco, I need a deli!

15:01.900 --> 15:03.200
We have a deli order!

15:03.200 --> 15:05.200
50 Type B homing missiles!

15:05.200 --> 15:06.270
15 close-range!

15:06.270 --> 15:07.790
750 slime bullets!

15:09.600 --> 15:12.040
What are you doing?
No, not that way!

15:12.040 --> 15:13.770
Dammit, let me go!

15:13.770 --> 15:15.640
You're...

15:15.640 --> 15:17.130
Manager, here's the list.

15:24.720 --> 15:25.720
I won't lose!

15:25.720 --> 15:27.920
I don't need the help of a man!

15:27.920 --> 15:30.250
Dammit, take this thing off!

15:32.330 --> 15:33.330
Come on.

15:33.330 --> 15:36.160
I'll show you the work
of a stagehand.

15:40.870 --> 15:42.500
- Let's go.
- Y-Yeah!

15:51.880 --> 15:53.050
All of you.

15:53.050 --> 15:54.650
I'm gonna do this at once!

15:54.650 --> 15:56.250
50 seconds!

15:56.250 --> 15:56.910
Deli begin!

16:05.090 --> 16:06.730
15% left!

16:06.730 --> 16:07.160
Heads up!

16:12.200 --> 16:14.440
This is the work of a stagehand?

16:14.440 --> 16:15.370
I told you.

16:15.370 --> 16:17.930
The pilot isn't flying all by herself.

16:19.610 --> 16:20.510
Deli complete!

16:20.510 --> 16:21.980
Get out there, girls!

16:21.980 --> 16:23.200
I'm so full!

16:27.280 --> 16:29.520
Hey, you got one left!

16:29.520 --> 16:30.950
Oh, is that right?

16:30.950 --> 16:32.350
Well, I brought it out here.

16:32.350 --> 16:33.980
It'd be a shame not to use it.

16:43.700 --> 16:44.190
That's...

16:45.500 --> 16:47.530
Hibiki the man is here!

16:47.530 --> 16:48.260
Mr. Alien!

16:54.510 --> 16:56.740
How dare you do that?

16:56.740 --> 16:57.340
What?

16:57.340 --> 16:59.710
Move, dammit!

16:59.710 --> 17:00.680
Pathetic...

17:00.680 --> 17:02.350
Mr. Alien!

17:02.350 --> 17:03.710
Let's combine!

17:03.950 --> 17:04.780
Dita, don't!

17:07.760 --> 17:08.760
I can't lose...

17:08.760 --> 17:11.780
...in a place like this!

17:15.200 --> 17:16.730
What?

17:16.730 --> 17:17.860
I-It can't be!

17:31.010 --> 17:32.210
No way!

17:32.210 --> 17:33.510
So cool!

17:34.920 --> 17:37.580
He sure has a lot
of tricks up his sleeve...

17:46.760 --> 17:48.030
What is this?

17:48.030 --> 17:51.000
What are you doing here?
I don't need your help!

17:51.000 --> 17:51.600
Get off!

17:51.600 --> 17:53.360
If I could, I would've already!

17:56.040 --> 17:57.560
We don't have time to fight!

18:05.510 --> 18:07.180
What's with that acceleration?

18:07.180 --> 18:08.670
I envy Meia...

18:09.820 --> 18:11.850
My body's not gonna last long...

18:11.850 --> 18:13.650
You sure talk a lot.

18:13.650 --> 18:14.560
Shut up...

18:14.560 --> 18:15.920
It's proof I'm alive!

18:15.920 --> 18:18.020
We'll see how long that lasts...

18:26.970 --> 18:27.970
I was waiting...

18:27.970 --> 18:28.700
...for this!

18:44.020 --> 18:47.890
It looks like you weren't
fit to be a stagehand.

18:47.890 --> 18:50.620
I think I'm going to be
sick looking at this.

18:50.620 --> 18:52.760
Don't throw away those spheres!

18:52.760 --> 18:54.250
There's a way we can use them.

19:01.900 --> 19:04.270
What a mess of everything...

19:04.270 --> 19:07.340
To think that we'd
be thinking the same thing.

19:07.340 --> 19:09.040
You see now, right?

19:09.040 --> 19:11.640
You couldn't win with
just your Vanguard.

19:13.110 --> 19:15.100
And neither could
you with just your Dread.

19:17.850 --> 19:20.320
This is terrible!

19:20.320 --> 19:23.520
Mr. Alien was supposed
to combine with me!

19:23.520 --> 19:24.260
I see.

19:24.260 --> 19:29.300
That means that I might be able
to become elegant and awesome, too.

19:29.300 --> 19:30.730
I look forward to it.

19:34.300 --> 19:35.800
The ship's name?

19:35.800 --> 19:36.440
Right!

19:36.440 --> 19:38.610
The entire crew came up with ideas.

19:38.610 --> 19:40.670
Captain, please choose one!

19:40.670 --> 19:41.900
You don't mind?

19:42.680 --> 19:44.670
Please pick a cool-sounding one!

19:46.380 --> 19:47.580
Nirvana?

19:47.580 --> 19:48.880
This sounds good.

19:48.880 --> 19:50.080
Whose was it?

19:50.080 --> 19:52.450
Nirvana was the vice-captain's!

19:52.450 --> 19:53.990
All right, then this one it is.

19:53.990 --> 19:56.960
From today, this ship
is the Nirvana!

19:56.960 --> 19:58.190
I knew it...

20:02.230 --> 20:03.220
You're back!

20:04.460 --> 20:06.630
Hey, what's with that Vanguard?

20:06.630 --> 20:07.460
Are you all right?

20:09.640 --> 20:12.370
She really pisses me off!

20:12.370 --> 20:14.070
Come on, cheer up!

20:14.070 --> 20:15.200
What the hell am I?

20:16.610 --> 20:18.710
Mr. Alien!

20:18.710 --> 20:19.370
Here.

20:21.620 --> 20:23.350
My pellet!

20:23.350 --> 20:24.150
Here's lunch!

20:24.150 --> 20:26.450
It's a disgrace to not
eat what you're given!

20:27.390 --> 20:28.860
Bite down.

20:28.860 --> 20:29.690
Chew.

20:31.730 --> 20:32.660
Swallow.

20:35.960 --> 20:37.430
What is this?

20:37.430 --> 20:38.730
It's good, isn't it?

20:42.440 --> 20:45.110
Mr. Alien, promise you'll
only combine with me!

20:45.110 --> 20:47.240
Come on, Mr. Alien!

20:47.240 --> 20:48.610
I'm not an alien!

20:51.910 --> 20:55.620
I'm done entering the sphere's
enemy/ ally detection system.

20:55.620 --> 20:58.290
So you're using the enemy
as something to hide under...

20:58.290 --> 20:59.220
Launching now!

21:06.990 --> 21:09.260
I hope they get it...

21:09.260 --> 21:12.700
But even if they get it, we don't
know if they'll accept it...

21:13.630 --> 21:16.570
Wish hard for it.

21:16.570 --> 21:20.470
That way, someday
the wish will reach them.

21:32.150 --> 21:37.760
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.760 --> 21:43.260
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.260 --> 21:49.500
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.500 --> 21:59.810
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.810 --> 22:02.350
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.350 --> 22:14.130
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:14.130 --> 22:25.740
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.740 --> 22:37.550
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.550 --> 22:51.420
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
